00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:29.462 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah, 710. 7'10".

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:32.599 align:start size:94% position:6%
He says, "It should be illegal
to let Netflix ask,

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:33.533 line:92%
