00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:48.114 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Leave me be.

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:50.617 line:92%
This is from @lizzieisbusy.

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:53.119 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, she is.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.119 --> 00:00:53.653 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
