00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:31.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, actually we only do --
sorry, we only do --

00:01:31.558 --> 00:01:32.725 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Chips?
-What's that?

00:01:32.725 --> 00:01:34.160 line:92%
