things will happen.

00:01:44.304 --> 00:01:45.171 line:92%
-I'm not gonna take it out.

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:46.739 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, aisle four
was just destroyed.

00:01:46.739 --> 00:01:47.574 line:92%
Please stop touching the chip.

00:01:47.574 --> 00:01:49.943 align:start size:94% position:6%
